          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बाळगणे — bāḷagṇe — \"to entertain (a hope); to keep\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "त्याने निकालाबद्दल मोठी आशा बाळगली होती. tyāne nikālābaddal moṭhī āśā bāḷaglī hotī. He had cherished high hopes about the result."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने आशा बाळगली, tyāne āśā bāḷaglī."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आशा बाळगणे (bāḷagṇe), to cherish a hope; राग बाळगणे (bāḷagṇe), to bear a grudge."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बाळगणे (bāḷagṇe) is a Marathi verb whose origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
