          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विशद करणे — viśad karṇe — \"to elucidate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शिक्षकांनी उदाहरण देऊन नियम विशद केला. śikṣakānnī udāhraṇ deūn niyam viśad kelā. The teacher explained the rule in detail with an example."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने विशद केलं, tyāne viśad kelaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal; in speech समजावून सांगणे."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विशद करणे (viśad karṇe) joins the tatsama विशद, Sanskrit viśada, \"clear, bright\" (Monier-Williams), to करणे, \"to make\": to make clear."
            }
          ]
        },
